# Standalone API Tests for SWMS Backend (HPL 2026 Week 1 Specification)
# You can run these using REST Client in VS Code / Antigravity or convert to cURL commands.

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### 2. Register Researcher Account (API-01, BR-08: starts as is_active = false)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Researcher",
  "email": "new_researcher@swms.gov.in",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Login as Admin (API-02)
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@swms.dev",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Admin Activates User Account (API-18)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/{{newUserId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true,
  "role": "planner"
}

### 5. Login as Planner (API-02)
# @name plannerLogin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "planner@swms.dev",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Create Habitation (API-05)
# @name createHabitation
POST http://localhost:4000/api/habitations
Authorization: Bearer {{plannerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shirva Town Ward 4",
  "type": "town",
  "latitude": 13.2145,
  "longitude": 74.7398
}

### 7. Get Habitation Profile (API-06)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/habitations/{{createHabitation.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{plannerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 8. Upsert Parameter Category (API-10, BR-03)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/habitations/{{createHabitation.response.body.data.id}}/parameters/demography
Authorization: Bearer {{plannerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "population": 4300,
  "populationDensityPerSqKm": 950,
  "growthRatePct": 2.1,
  "floatingPopPct": 8,
  "householdSize": 4.6,
  "literacyPct": 78
}

### 9. Read Parameter Category History (API-11)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/habitations/{{createHabitation.response.body.data.id}}/parameters/demography/history
Authorization: Bearer {{plannerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 10. Fetch GeoJSON Overlay (API-13)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/habitations/{{createHabitation.response.body.data.id}}/map-layers?overlay=true
Authorization: Bearer {{plannerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 11. Refresh Access Token (API-03)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{plannerLogin.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}
